WEBVTT

NOTE 时间轴按各句字符数占比在实测总时长 176.472s 上分配；合成语速恒定，未做逐句对齐校正。

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.459
The Jing-Zhang Handover Line translates the railway shift handover — the most ordinary and most rigorous institution this line ever produced — into an urban protocol for AI.

2
00:00:10.459 --> 00:00:15.477
For any AI service on this belt, the same task must also be completable without AI.

3
00:00:15.477 --> 00:00:17.895
If it cannot, the service does not open.

4
00:00:17.895 --> 00:00:20.011
This is not a supplementary clause.

5
00:00:20.011 --> 00:00:22.490
It is the criterion for the whole scheme.

6
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:39.659
It replaces smart-city metrics that no ordinary person can check — device counts, automation rates — with a question anyone can answer for themselves: without a smartphone, without reading Chinese, without sight of a screen, or simply not wanting to use AI, can I still get this done?

7
00:00:39.659 --> 00:00:47.156
One continuous handover line runs north to south along the Jing-Zhang railway heritage park, linking three handover grounds.

8
00:00:47.156 --> 00:00:49.816
Zhongzhiyuan in the north is the build yard.

9
00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.751
It answers: can this be trusted?

10
00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:58.159
Models, robots and compute enter testing carrying their version, their risks and their shutdown procedure.

11
00:00:58.159 --> 00:01:01.907
The AI Origin Community in the middle is the open-source yard.

12
00:01:01.907 --> 00:01:03.963
It answers: can this be explained?

13
00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:08.739
Results, licences, failures and limits of applicability are published together.

14
00:01:08.739 --> 00:01:11.217
Dazhongsi in the south is the civic yard.

15
00:01:11.217 --> 00:01:13.515
It answers: can this enter daily life?

16
00:01:13.515 --> 00:01:19.137
Public services keep a human counter, a no-AI equivalent, an appeal route and an exit record.

17
00:01:19.137 --> 00:01:24.518
Eight east-west stitch links bring in universities, parks, communities and rail stations.

18
00:01:24.518 --> 00:01:26.211
Two wings support the whole.

19
00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:30.805
If only one thing could be built first, it would be a public handover table.

20
00:01:30.805 --> 00:01:34.372
One table, and four items that must all be present at once.

21
00:01:34.372 --> 00:01:40.901
The release position, holding four cards: version, scope of applicability, known faults, shutdown procedure.

22
00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:47.491
The receiving position, where the only choices are accept, refuse or defer — and the decision must be signed.

23
00:01:47.491 --> 00:01:55.230
The open-items board, where everything the previous shift failed to close hangs in public and may not be taken down at handover.

24
00:01:55.230 --> 00:02:01.215
And the human counter, depending on no device at all, which must exist before the smart layer does.

25
00:02:01.215 --> 00:02:03.814
The order of the four cannot be rearranged.

26
00:02:03.814 --> 00:02:07.200
If only one segment can be kept, keep the human counter.

27
00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:12.943
Every spatial, brand, event, timing and role arrangement in this proposal is conceptual advice.

28
00:02:12.943 --> 00:02:16.631
It is not statutory planning and not a government commitment.

29
00:02:16.631 --> 00:02:22.374
The boundary is provisional; the geometry recomputes, but it does not carry official precision.

30
00:02:22.374 --> 00:02:25.941
The eight roles have post specifications, not appointments.

31
00:02:25.941 --> 00:02:33.256
All twelve scenario shift ledgers stand at "refused" — because the three acceptance gates are unmet in every one of them.

32
00:02:33.256 --> 00:02:37.609
On paper the protocol correctly refuses all twelve of its own scenarios.

33
00:02:37.609 --> 00:02:43.232
That is the behaviour it should have: prove the refusal path works before discussing release.

34
00:02:43.232 --> 00:02:44.441
Capability may move.

35
00:02:44.441 --> 00:02:46.436
Accountability must stay visible.

36
00:02:46.436 --> 00:02:56.472
Bring a problem you can state in public and a responsibility you are willing to carry, and complete one handover here that can be withdrawn, reproduced and handed on.
